[{"client_msg_id":"af3ff5e2-1bc5-4fe5-9517-de87fce02169","type":"message","user":"U7986PPFH","text":"`%Y-%m-%d` は `%F` と書ける","ts":"1625324310.279500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aTDfm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df476ce6-00b3-4561-9fad-5761f05625d2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"メモった","ts":"1625316300.279000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oi1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7358bde-8cea-4ff0-81cb-9abe01154285","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/skanehira/Vim%E3%81%A7%E6%97%A5%E4%BB%98%E3%82%92unixtime%E3%81%AB%E7%BD%AE%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\u003e","ts":"1625316299.278600","attachments":[{"fallback":"ゴリラ: Vimで日付をunixtimeに置換する - ゴリラ","id":1,"title":"Vimで日付をunixtimeに置換する - ゴリラ","title_link":"https://scrapbox.io/skanehira/Vim%E3%81%A7%E6%97%A5%E4%BB%98%E3%82%92unixtime%E3%81%AB%E7%BD%AE%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B","text":"jsonの日付データをyyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ssからunixtimeに置換する方法 code:json { \"create_at\": \"2021-01-02 15:10:13\", \"update_at\": \"2021-03-02 21:10:00\" } code:vim :%s;\\(\"\\d\\+-\\d\\+-.*\"\\);\\=strptime(\"\\\"%Y-%m-%d %T\\\"\", subma","thumb_url":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/content-logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"ゴリラ","service_icon":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":288,"thumb_height":288,"from_url":"https://scrapbox.io/skanehira/Vim%E3%81%A7%E6%97%A5%E4%BB%98%E3%82%92unixtime%E3%81%AB%E7%BD%AE%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B","original_url":"https://scrapbox.io/skanehira/Vim%E3%81%A7%E6%97%A5%E4%BB%98%E3%82%92unixtime%E3%81%AB%E7%BD%AE%E6%8F%9B%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GzY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b7a1d6b-2e5c-42d7-a04d-4a7da5e9af24","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"遅レスだけど `submatch()` ですね\n```%s;\\(\\d\\+-\\d\\+-*\\);\\=strftime(submatch(1));g```\nマッチ対象が全体ならカッコはいらないね\n```%s;\\d\\+-\\d\\+-*;\\=strftime(submatch(0));g```","ts":"1625315411.277500","thread_ts":"1625296471.253700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yqIuU"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"709cd290-28d1-4085-8d2f-56afc48b2d6d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それができれば、↓みたいな（正規表現適当）のがかけて一発でいけそう\n```%s;\\(\\d\\+-\\d\\+-*\\);\\=strftime(\\1);g```","ts":"1625296471.253700","thread_ts":"1625296471.253700","last_read":"1625315494.278200","subscribed":true,"reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOEQG"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"d17a0e62-d71c-4ed7-aaf4-6209240b879b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そっちで逆に `\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` で改行コードを出したかったら `\"\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"` する感じになりますな(以前thincaさんが説明してたやつね)","ts":"1625304551.276500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D8tc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"492a47cb-5a47-4b79-a3b0-e126cd70b018","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あー、`\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` という文字列をかえす関数を挟めば改行文字判定されないんですね","ts":"1625304444.275500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"otx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1ab5b0f-528f-4fc5-bdc3-550f9d830012","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは関数を定義してその中で普通の文字列を出す、そっちはマッピングのエスケープ処理はされない","ts":"1625304266.274600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zPv4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78a779db-d5c3-4ee9-a1d9-6042565b0f3e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"機械的にマッピングするのなら`\u0026lt;`を`\u0026lt;lt\u0026gt;`に置換してしまえばいいはず","ts":"1625304176.274000","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1625304189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ntwL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56440241-4974-4ac6-bd20-711f17795219","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あーなるほど!","ts":"1625304149.273300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xiC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3eaa1ad2-bf26-4149-8b2b-9a7e2500b2fc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちょっと不恰好だけどまあ仕方ない","ts":"1625304137.273000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q=M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2df63beb-bbdc-4d3d-9aa0-f64a4e3c1588","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`\u0026lt;lt\u0026gt;CR\u0026gt;`","ts":"1625304130.272700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LsUY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e54b132-3634-47f8-b9b0-19a57ae2c789","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"mapping で `\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` という文字列を出力したいんですが、どうにもエスケープ処理をどう挟めばいいか分からず...\n```nmap \u0026lt;CR\u0026gt; :echom '\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;'\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```\nだと `^M` になってしまって...\n// 実際にやりたいことは `lhs` の内容を文字列として `rhs` に評価させたい","ts":"1625304026.272200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Kkp5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f887a94-9542-4157-bc6b-7b84fb214d81","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"`:%!jq -Rr 'strptime(\"\\%F \\%T\") | strftime(\"\\%s\")'`","ts":"1625302302.268100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBnXR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FFB44504-3853-4DE6-813E-30CA343932AB","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1625300918.267900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngQu+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95715687-133C-470D-B8E3-01AF2FB4A976","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"次やる時使ってみます","ts":"1625300916.267800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/aLd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84007D7F-7C8B-44CE-BB00-9B587AE168B1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625300910.267500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7=W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5a04ef6-ed6a-4265-ab1b-27c2a9c3c689","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"そうですね 関数化して、command 定義してって感じですね","ts":"1625299954.267200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QS2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f53e865c-fbfa-4952-899d-6a81f71c42a3","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"最後の行のやつを変数に入れて使うとかそういう話ではなくです?","ts":"1625299775.266600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rT4iI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a144e0cd-63f0-442f-be88-7e23d1e9570c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Python, Rubyあたりだとstrftime/strptimeがあるので雑に使っちゃいがち","ts":"1625299597.265400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oiw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27e0e3a7-afa8-4d10-9812-418e02a6805d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1625298672260300\u003e\nこれって、結局どう使って置換するイメージでしょうか？","ts":"1625299584.264900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 3rd, 2021 12:51 AM] raa0121: ```let g:V = vital#of('vital')\nlet g:DateTime = g:V.import('DateTime')\necho g:DateTime.from_format(\"2021-07-03 16:45:15\", \"%Y-%m-%d %T\").format(\"%s\")```\nつまり、これで任意の時間を変換できますね 良かった","id":1,"author_id":"U06ECBRTJ","author_name":"raa0121","author_subname":"raa0121","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06ECBRTJ","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35b032d7b2d4182b0c2de1ef85ba91f2.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0012-48.png","text":"```let g:V = vital#of('vital')\nlet g:DateTime = g:V.import('DateTime')\necho g:DateTime.from_format(\"2021-07-03 16:45:15\", \"%Y-%m-%d %T\").format(\"%s\")```\nつまり、これで任意の時間を変換できますね 良かった","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1625298672.260300,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1625298672260300","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1625298672260300"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lJtf7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20a3a433-3a40-4781-98df-90f60b364c6e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"Goは time.Now().Unix() ですね","ts":"1625299419.263600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/qw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2847eff-88aa-4924-a883-971372edb267","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"他のdatetime formatとだいたい一緒そうですが、Goだとないのか...","ts":"1625299386.263400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d5l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d20ef08a-3352-4617-a069-8b6970d0d353","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1625299295.262500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eafe268b-56bd-452d-87c8-ab81cd49dcce","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```  o    %s  The number of seconds since the Epoch, 1970-01-01 00:00:00 +0000.```","ts":"1625299293.262200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UUJ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b6722a9-c8ea-4f81-8c98-34ffa6c2b377","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ヘルプ見てみる","ts":"1625299268.261700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4t4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a29dfe84-3b28-4bb9-a361-6ef37ac4679e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```format(\"%s\")```\nの%sは何だろ","ts":"1625299260.261300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"662g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33c9677f-8741-428c-b941-64d72a7ab647","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"マクロで全部やってしまった…","ts":"1625299196.260900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rsg+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3122a381-7cdc-4366-9554-039cf7cdd1fa","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003c@UDDCM376D\u003e ↑はどうですか？","ts":"1625298703.260700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rer5I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2a44abc-0683-4e38-af9e-0a0df9de211a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```let g:V = vital#of('vital')\nlet g:DateTime = g:V.import('DateTime')\necho g:DateTime.from_format(\"2021-07-03 16:45:15\", \"%Y-%m-%d %T\").format(\"%s\")```\nつまり、これで任意の時間を変換できますね 良かった","ts":"1625298672.260300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Df"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d906b2d-2190-4357-ab55-dc9795e7f78f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```strftime```\nはちょっと用途とか利用がちがうか(Windowsだし...)","ts":"1625298531.259800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LUP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab997292-40a4-4975-9f0b-5d64f04e908e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`echo g:DateTime.now().format(\"%s\")` ならいけました","ts":"1625298486.259400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76a410b6-401b-4ecc-b2bd-dcd462cbd2c0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```let s:DateTime = g:V.import('DateTime')\nlet s:now = s:DateTime.now()\necho s:now.strftime(\"%s\")\necho s:now.to_string()```\nで\n```\n2021-07-03 16:45:15 +0900```\nってなるね、あれ?","ts":"1625298337.259200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"99M7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"008eaeb9-8734-4dd0-a1b4-ddb24920167d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```let g:V = vital#of('vital')\nlet g:DateTime = g:V.import('DateTime')\necho g:DateTime.now().strftime(\"%s\")```\nしたけど空っぽなのか","ts":"1625297978.258800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JHlz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31285237-9c04-4845-bb98-526260ddbbc5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どっちが推奨だっけ?","ts":"1625297303.258200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qjah"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f97292b0-d782-45d9-a9ba-3876350b445b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普通にプラグインとして入れているなら\n```  let g:V = vital#of('vital')\n  let s:now  = g:V.import('DateTime').now()```\nとかする","ts":"1625297278.257900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5=1N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfd44711-45b3-48e9-b4e5-a7f216209a24","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これでいいのかな","ts":"1625297224.257600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ec2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66ac0db8-a3ce-4927-b478-060d146769e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/config/blob/7bce84face984a47921a53341fd44db0fbf32485/dotfiles/dot.vim/vimrc#L154\u003e","ts":"1625297218.257300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/config/blob/7bce84face984a47921a53341fd44db0fbf32485/dotfiles/dot.vim/vimrc |