client_msg_id":"7dd544ab-2139-4bdd-b28f-5b041f6ef8c9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 頻繁に使うならVim script使うのがよさそう\n普通にvim scirptで処理したほうが良いってことか","ts":"1625296195.249500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jlUYW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69264b14-2994-4cfc-ae14-0e6d5c2b0e81","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u0026gt; 全システムで使用可能ではない。調べるにはこれを使う:  \n一応明記してるか","ts":"1625296152.248800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2JXhB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a195dca-db0e-4009-a49d-5cc7b734f7ce","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"時間、人が決めた概念なのにヒューマンフレンドリーじゃないの仕様作った人が無能だったのでは（暴言）","ts":"1625296134.248200","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1625296150.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5RX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c0176a8-6cc5-4860-9d8c-1dc47a66cf9d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"書いてないな","ts":"1625296119.247900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"twp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54d92201-2505-490f-a989-be346ad423f8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"Cのstrptimeを使っているっぽい","ts":"1625296118.247800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eJU"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nstrptime({format}, {timestring})                                *strptime()*\n                結果は数値で、{format} で指定した書式に一致する {timestring} が\n                表す日付と時刻の unix タイムスタンプを返す。\n \n                受け入れられる {format} はシステムに依存するため、これは移植可\n                能ではない! 書式は C 関数 strptime() のマニュアルページを参照\n                すること。特に \"%c\" は避けること。$TZ の値も影響する。\n \n                {timestring} が {format} でパースできないときは 0 が返される。\n                {timestring} の書式が分からないときは、非 0 の値が返るまで、異\n                なった {format} の値を試してみるとよい。\n \n                |strftime()| も参照。\n                例:  \n                  :echo strptime(\"%Y %b %d %X\", \"1997 Apr 27 11:49:23\")\n                  862156163  \n                  :echo strftime(\"%c\", strptime(\"%y%m%d %T\", \"970427 11:53:55\"))\n                  Sun Apr 27 11:53:55 1997  \n                  :echo strftime(\"%c\", strptime(\"%Y%m%d%H%M%S\", \"19970427115355\") + 3600)\n                  Sun Apr 27 12:53:55 1997\n \n                全システムで使用可能ではない。調べるにはこれを使う:  \n                        :if exists(\"*strptime\")\n```","ts":"1625296110.247300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d898ac3d-2ca8-4ab3-993c-b4e36b2e0d17","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h strptime()","ts":"1625296110.247200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/v5pY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"136ff3a8-2afe-40bf-93d4-15cc40e79178","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":wakaru:","ts":"1625296100.246800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RyCx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24ca7591-9813-4fad-b818-8e6f1711457f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"windows では使えないでしたっけ(うろ覚え","ts":"1625296100.246700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TI/UW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8d3656a-eeb5-4bc9-a564-3c3abf8e28da","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"時間という概念難しすぎる","ts":"1625296096.246400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HSQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f0e43bb-7d5d-4fe6-832d-ef376d20904e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですね","ts":"1625296081.245700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delet